pageType: final
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$primary"
elements:
  - elementId: center-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [540, 160, 200, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: main-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 180, 1000, 60]
    content:
      style: "$coverTitle"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>总结与展望</p>

  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [190, 260, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$coverSubtitle"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>网络设备Web安全研究已形成全链路技术体系</p>

  - elementId: summary-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [140, 320, 1000, 220]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF10"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#FFFFFF30"

  - elementId: summary-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [180, 340, 920, 180]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "#E2E8F0"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.8
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>• 完整链路：Source识别 → Propagation追踪 → Sink发现 → Verification闭环</p>
        <p>• 技术演进：硬编码匹配 → LLM语义理解 → 智能Token推断 → 约束一致性+Agent闭环</p>
        <p>• 未来方向：大模型驱动自动化漏洞分析、多语言混合架构通用化、真实设备高可信验证</p>

  - elementId: thanks
    elementType: text
    bounds: [340, 580, 600, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>感谢聆听</p>

  - elementId: author-info
    elementType: text
    bounds: [340, 630, 600, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#94A3B8"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>罗夏朴 | 香港理工大学 电子计算学系 | 2025</p>
